OL,3,GNEWSATwo men arrested after weapons
OL,4,Afight near school
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after a
OL,7,Ffight involving "bladed weapons" led to
OL,8,Fa secondary school being put into
OL,9,Flockdown.
OL,11,FPolice were called to reports of a
OL,12,Fnumber of men fighting near Dixons City
OL,13,FAcademy, in Ripley Street, at about
OL,14,F13:15 GMT on Wednesday.
OL,16,FOne of the men, who were both aged 19,
OL,17,Fwas arrested on suspicion of affray
OL,18,Fwhile the other was held on suspicion
OL,19,Fof possession of an offensive weapon.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
